    "detailed_description": "<strong>You're a succubus...<br><br>You're Azizella, Binder of Souls, and you have just escaped the Abyss. Now, a free demon, you seek to outwit the fiends that hunt you as you plot your own rise to ultimate power.</strong><br><br>The game includes the complete story of Demon's Choice in <strong>11 chapters</strong>. No additional purchase.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055820/extras/6008236c54b9ddb257687d3a2b196f07.webp?t=1726218795\" /></div>Zero learning curve. Read the story and make decisions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055820/extras/6008236c54b9ddb257687d3a2b196f07.webp?t=1726218795\" /></div>Outcomes are determined by decisions you make.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055820/extras/6008236c54b9ddb257687d3a2b196f07.webp?t=1726218795\" /></div>More than 334,000 words for <strong>20+ hours of gameplay</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055820/extras/6008236c54b9ddb257687d3a2b196f07.webp?t=1726218795\" /></div>Stay alive and sane. Use your magic and gather gold!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055820/extras/6008236c54b9ddb257687d3a2b196f07.webp?t=1726218795\" /></div>Score and rank at the end.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055820/extras/6008236c54b9ddb257687d3a2b196f07.webp?t=1726218795\" /></div>Ambient sounds and music.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c